{
  "info": {
    "name": "Walatra - Cart dan Checkout",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "Jalankan request secara manual sesuai urutan. Isi customer_token, ID listing/varian/bundle, dan address_id. Backend menyimpan cart, bukan checkbox. Tinjau preview sebelum membuat order; collection runner tidak mewakili persetujuan user. Request di folder opsional mengubah/menghapus cart. base_url sudah mencakup /api/v1. Client lama tanpa token checkout perlu diperbarui. Pembayaran ada di koleksi Midtrans Core Payments. Pengaturan URL: base_url wajib mencakup /api/v1 tanpa slash terakhir, misalnya http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1. Jika Environment aktif memiliki variable dengan nama sama, nilainya menimpa Collection, termasuk ID/token yang diisi otomatis; samakan nilainya atau hapus duplikat Environment. Panduan: docs/api/postman-setup.md."
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{customer_token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "customer_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "listing_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "variant_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "bundle_listing_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "product_cart_item_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "bundle_cart_item_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "address_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "checkout_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "order_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "order_idempotency_key",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Alur cart sampai order",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Tambah produk",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/cart/items",
            "description": "Isi ID katalog aktif. Quantity dijumlahkan; tidak ada idempotency tambah cart. Gunakan quantity dari respons.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"type\": \"product\",\n  \"listing_id\": \"{{listing_id}}\",\n  \"variant_id\": \"{{variant_id}}\",\n  \"quantity\": 2\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const data = pm.response.json().data;",
                  "  const item = data.items.find(i => i.type === 'product' && String(i.listing_id) === pm.variables.get('listing_id') && String(i.variant_id) === pm.variables.get('variant_id'));",
                  "  if (item) pm.collectionVariables.set('product_cart_item_id', String(item.id));",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Tambah bundle",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/cart/items",
            "description": "",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"type\": \"bundle\",\n  \"bundle_listing_id\": \"{{bundle_listing_id}}\",\n  \"quantity\": 1\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const data = pm.response.json().data;",
                  "  const item = data.items.find(i => i.type === 'bundle' && String(i.bundle_listing_id) === pm.variables.get('bundle_listing_id'));",
                  "  if (item) pm.collectionVariables.set('bundle_cart_item_id', String(item.id));",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "3. Lihat seluruh cart",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/cart",
            "description": "Tanpa pilihan, data.selection kosong/nol. Seluruh item tetap terlihat, termasuk is_available=false."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "4. Ringkasan produk dan bundle terpilih",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/cart?cart_item_ids[]={{product_cart_item_id}}&cart_item_ids[]={{bundle_cart_item_id}}",
            "description": "Menghitung pilihan tersedia pada data.selection tanpa menghubungi gudang. unavailable_item_ids harus ditangani sebelum preview."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "5. Preview pilihan dan alamat",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/checkout/preview",
            "description": "Isi address_id milik customer. Preview memperbarui harga; tinjau price_changed/price_changes dan total. Token 15 menit wajib untuk order baru. Menjalankan preview lagi menyiapkan key checkout baru.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"cart_item_ids\": [\n    \"{{product_cart_item_id}}\",\n    \"{{bundle_cart_item_id}}\"\n  ],\n  \"address_id\": \"{{address_id}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200 && pm.response.json().data.checkout_available) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('checkout_token', pm.response.json().data.checkout_token);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('order_idempotency_key', 'checkout-' + pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$guid}}'));",
                  "} else { pm.collectionVariables.unset('checkout_token'); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "6. Buat order atau retry key yang sama",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Idempotency-Key",
                "value": "{{order_idempotency_key}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/orders",
            "description": "Jalankan setelah user menyetujui preview. Retry dengan key sama mengembalikan order lama; tidak membuat VA/QRIS. Gunakan koleksi Midtrans untuk membuat pembayaran.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"cart_item_ids\": [\n    \"{{product_cart_item_id}}\",\n    \"{{bundle_cart_item_id}}\"\n  ],\n  \"address_id\": \"{{address_id}}\",\n  \"checkout_token\": \"{{checkout_token}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if ([200, 201].includes(pm.response.code)) pm.collectionVariables.set('order_id', String(pm.response.json().data.id));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "7. Detail order",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/orders/{{order_id}}",
            "description": ""
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Opsional - manajemen cart (jalankan sesuai kebutuhan)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Ganti quantity produk menjadi 3",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/cart/items/{{product_cart_item_id}}",
            "description": "Mengganti jumlah, bukan menambah. Item tidak tersedia ditolak 409 STALE_CART. Perbarui preview setelah perubahan.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"quantity\": 3\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Ringkasan hanya produk",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/cart?cart_item_ids[]={{product_cart_item_id}}",
            "description": ""
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Hapus item produk",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/cart/items/{{product_cart_item_id}}",
            "description": ""
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Kosongkan cart",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/cart",
            "description": ""
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
